id: STYLE-045
ilities: [modifiability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Mixed async patterns (.then and await in same file)
category: style
severity: warning
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: await
patterns:
  - regex: \.then\s*\(
    message: "Mixed async patterns — file uses both await and .then(). Pick one style for consistency."
fix: Use async/await consistently. It's more readable and has better error handling than .then() chains.
